# Shipbreaker Shoals: The Seabed, track 1 (SPEC 19.6). A loop round the
# listing wrecks on the old shoals: along the north reach under the bows
# (their shadows across the sand), down the east side through the tide
# pools left in a wreck's scour, then into the container-stack maze the
# container ship spilled (chicanes between the stacks, a container sliding
# off a listing stack across the lane), out along the south reach and back
# up the west side past the service bay.
name SHIPBREAK SHOALS
order 1
floor sand
background shoals
league seabed
width 52
# x    y    half   features
 180  140   54                     # start line, heading east
 440  120   54     crates
 700  140   52     shadow,len=20   # under a wreck's bow
 880  200   50
 910  360   48     coolant         # tide pools in the scour
 860  500   46
 700  520   42                     # into the container maze
 540  560   42
 460  660   42
 560  740   42
 720  700   42
 860  760   44
 880  880   46
 700  920   46
 480  905   48     sweeper,period=720,speed=44,size=16   # a container slides off the stack
 300  900   50     crates
 160  800   52
 140  600   52
 260  470   50     bay:right
 160  330   52
 140  230   54
props bow,anchor seg 1 side left gap 90 off 26
props bow,buoy seg 3 side right gap 80 off 24
props container seg 6 side both gap 60 off 20
props container,buoy seg 9 side both gap 70 off 20
props anchor,bow seg 16 side left gap 90 off 26
props buoy seg 19 side left gap 80 off 24
